   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2023-03-28",
   "text": "Setting Consumer Standards for Lithium-Ion Batteries Act\n This bill requires the Consumer Product Safety Commission to issue a consumer product safety standard for rechargeable lithium-ion batteries used in micromobility devices, such as electric bicycles and scooters, to protect against the risk of fires."
